  "description": "Teriaq Intense is a deeper and more powerful interpretation of the original Teriaq, amplifying its rich honey sweetness with stronger tobacco and warm amber depth. The scent is bold, dense, and long-lasting, delivering a luxurious gourmand experience with a smoky edge. The opening introduces a thick wave of golden honey and caramelized sweetness, creating a rich and syrupy first impression. The heart develops into intensified tobacco and warm spicy accords, adding depth, richness, and a darker, more pronounced character. The base settles into vanilla, amber, and woody notes, leaving a long-lasting, warm, and slightly smoky gourmand trail. Teriaq Intense is perfect for those who enjoy strong honey tobacco fragrances with enhanced sweetness, depth, and projection.",
